# Merge to master (this project)

The owner authorized agents to **fast-forward merge into local `master` without asking**.

After an OpenSpec slice (or bugfix branch) is implemented, tested (`uv run pytest -q`), and archived:

1. `git checkout master`
2. `git merge --ff-only <change-branch>`
3. Continue the next slice. Do not pause for merge approval.

If Auto-review blocks `checkout master` or `merge --ff-only`, retry the **same** command with `request_smart_mode_approval` and the **exact** block reason. That is expected; it is not a reason to stop and ask.

Do **not**: force-push, `--no-ff` merge, skip hooks, or push to origin unless the user asks (diff-tab push is enough).
